### VS Code REST Client (optional) — API examples
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@adminJwt = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_JWT
@userJwt = REPLACE_WITH_USER_JWT
@movieId = REPLACE_WITH_MOVIE_ID
@reviewId = REPLACE_WITH_REVIEW_ID

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice Doe",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPassword123!"
}

### Login (admin account is created via npm run seed:admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_PASSWORD"
}

### Create movie (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/movies
Authorization: Bearer {{adminJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Interstellar",
  "year": 2014,
  "genre": "Science Fiction",
  "director": "Christopher Nolan",
  "actors": ["Matthew McConaughey", "Anne Hathaway"],
  "description": "Explorers venture through a wormhole to save humanity."
}

### List movies with filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies?search=inter&year=2014&page=1&limit=10

### Get details, count and rating
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/{{movieId}}

### Create review (user)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/{{movieId}}/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 9,
  "text": "Wonderful acting and an exciting story."
}

### Read reviews
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/{{movieId}}/reviews

### Update review
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/reviews/{{reviewId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"rating":10}
